とがあります。","source_cn":"……阿邦德，我有一个问题想要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B113667A35D50D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521043005:0":{"text":"アバルド様と呼べと……まあいい、ここまで付き合ってくれたことに免じて、大目に見てやろう。","source_cn":"你应该叫我阿邦德殿下。不过看在你们陪我这么久的份上，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4058CC44B40A2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521043006:0":{"text":"何が聞きたいのだ？","source_cn":"你问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA56743EA28B4A56F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521043007:0":{"text":"……もし、あなたに決定権があったなら、あなたは、ヤクボルに戦争を仕掛けましたか？","source_cn":"……如果你能决定，你会向雅库伯尔发起战争吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x274A16A2C703AB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521043008:0":{"text":"うっ……それは、難しい質問だな……","source_cn":"唔……你问的问题好难回答……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D452DB49A9A683B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521043009:0":{"text":"答えは……分からない、だ。","source_cn":"我想……我不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0EDF0EB51BA41EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521043010:0":{"text":"どうして？あなたは領主さまなんでしょう？","source_cn":"为什么？你是领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCD72BB164BE54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521043011:0":{"text":"だが、戦争は民が望んでいることだ。","source_cn":"但是发动战争是呼临人的呼声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB41A9F72B452FB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521043012:1":{"text":"父上がまだご存命だった頃から、我々は獣人と衝突していた……","source_cn":"父亲还在的时候，呼临城就和兽人起过冲突……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B16257D39068EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521043013:0":{"text":"ホーリンとヤクボルの確執は今に始まったことではない。議事官や一般市民……それにペルセウスだって、獣人を嫌っておる。","source_cn":"呼临城和雅库伯尔的矛盾很久了。不止是议事官，还有那些普...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2905F0B896533395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521043014:0":{"text":"これは、領主の一存で決められることではないのだ。","source_cn":"不是领主想要怎么做，就能怎么做的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27BB4F089C2F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521043015:0":{"text":"もし、みんなあなたの言うことを聞いたとしたら？","source_cn":"如果民众都听你的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4F188ED19DFF847","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521043016:0":{"text":"そんなはずないだろう？彼らには彼ら自身の考えがある、何でもかんでも余に従わせるのは無理だ。","source_cn":"怎么可能？他们是人，有自己的想法，不可能完全听从我的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF210160C3D48EF1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521043017:0":{"text":"領主は国を治める立場にあるだけで、他の者となんら変わりはない……父上はそう言っていた。","source_cn":"我父亲说过，领主是统治城邦的人，但其实和其他人没区别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44116F7C247B7AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521043018:0":{"text":"皆が余の統治を受け入れているのは、そうすることで、穏やかな暮らしが送れるからだ。","source_cn":"大家服从我们的统治，是因为这样做，可以安稳地生活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D218FFB7E6423A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521043019:1":{"text":"もしそれが叶わなければ、人々は反発する。統治に、領主に……そして、時に自分自身にさえも。","source_cn":"如果不能安稳生活，人就会反抗。反抗统治，反抗领主……甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5A0972D0821953D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521043020:0":{"text":"その時は軍を使って、反発する人を処罰すればいいのでは？","source_cn":"那……为什么不派出军队？反抗的人，应该受到惩罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433185093E86C1A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521043021:0":{"text":"そ、そなたは、時々恐ろしいことを平気で言うのだな……","source_cn":"你……你有些想法真的很可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80B4147D4DB370C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521043022:0":{"text":"そなたは、反乱や暴動の現場を目にしたことがあるか？","source_cn":"你见过反抗的场景吗？那很惨烈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B96042B0256BD6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521043023:1":{"text":"飢饉が始まったばかりの頃、一袋のパンをめぐって度々殴り合いが起きていた。それまで裕福だった者たちは、布で顔を覆い、盗みや強盗を働くようになった……","source_cn":"饥荒刚开始的时候，有很多人为了一袋面包大打出手。还有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B19583665863DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521043024:0":{"text":"兵士たちがいくら制止しようとしても手に負えず……中には民衆に襲われたり、自分の槍で鎧を貫かれた者もいた……","source_cn":"士兵怎么管也管不过来，甚至还会被那些人打伤……被自己的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F5088297E9861B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: